    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A  Real-Time Strategy game set on Mycopia, a fungal planet with boundless resources,  protected by the Shroomies.<br><br>The year is 2062.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warp speed space travel has been possible for almost two decades, but humanity faces bigger problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After years of over-prescription, antibiotics have become entirely ineffective at treating even the smallest of illnesses. The top scientists of the world have been searching far and wide for a cure for a new superbug.<br><br>In a desperate attempt to save humanity, space explorers have been taking samples from planets in other solar systems, hoping to find a cure. <br><br>After years of searching the endless void of space and with little hope left for humanity, Mycopia is discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Home to the Shroomies, a fungal species that zealously fight for the safety of their Queen, it is also rich in immune-boosting mycelic serum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will command the Human space mission on Mycopia to extract the serum and bring it back to earth to begin formulating a cure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A  Real-Time Strategy game set on Mycopia, a fungal planet with boundless resources,  protected by the Shroomies.<br><br>The year is 2062.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Warp speed space travel has been possible for almost two decades, but humanity faces bigger problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After years of over-prescription, antibiotics have become entirely ineffective at treating even the smallest of illnesses. The top scientists of the world have been searching far and wide for a cure for a new superbug.<br><br>In a desperate attempt to save humanity, space explorers have been taking samples from planets in other solar systems, hoping to find a cure. <br><br>After years of searching the endless void of space and with little hope left for humanity, Mycopia is discovered. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Home to the Shroomies, a fungal species that zealously fight for the safety of their Queen, it is also rich in immune-boosting mycelic serum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will command the Human space mission on Mycopia to extract the serum and bring it back to earth to begin formulating a cure.</p>",
